    "id": "audience-research-nexus",
    "title": "Audience Research with Nexus",
    "category": "Research",
    "body": "# Audience Research with Nexus\n\n**Category:** Research\n**Source:** Module 3 Lesson 10\n**When to use:** Day 2 of onboarding, before writing any copy. Research feeds creative messaging, not targeting settings.\n**Estimated time:** 30 to 45 min\n\n---\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- [ ] Client business name, product or service, location, price range collected\n- [ ] Nexus prompt template ready\n- [ ] Client folder created at `clients/[name]/`\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [ ] **Gather inputs:**\n  - [ ] Business name\n  - [ ] What they sell (specific product or service, not \"marketing\")\n  - [ ] Location (city, state)\n  - [ ] Price range\n  - [ ] Primary offer they want pushed\n- [ ] **Run Nexus prompt, request:**\n  - [ ] Top 10 reasons to buy (emotional, not features)\n  - [ ] Top 5 purchase objections\n  - [ ] Top 5 trigger moments (what makes someone start shopping)\n  - [ ] Audience language and slang (actual words they use)\n  - [ ] Competitive alternatives (who they shop against)\n  - [ ] Relevant daily routine details (where, when, how they decide)\n- [ ] **Save output** to `clients/[name]/audience-research.md`\n- [ ] **Translate research into ad angles:**\n  - [ ] Each \"reason to buy\" becomes one of the 12 angles for Aurelius\n  - [ ] Each \"objection\" becomes a PAS or BAB ad addressing it\n  - [ ] Each \"trigger moment\" becomes a hook scenario\n  - [ ] Audience language replaces generic AI phrasing in copy\n\n## Notes\n\n- Research is for messaging, not targeting. Andromeda finds the audience if creative is diverse and on-message.\n- Reasons to buy are emotional, not features. \"Saves my Friday night\" not \"fast delivery.\"\n- Re-run Nexus quarterly or whenever a client's offer changes meaningfully.\n- Validate output against real reviews (Google, Yelp, Facebook). If Nexus says \"anxious about cost\" and 30 reviews mention pricing, it's a real angle.\n\n## Related SOPs\n\n- ad-copy-12-angle-generation\n- competitor-research-workflow\n- targeting-setup-broad\n"
