    "id": "campaign-structure-naming",
    "title": "Build Campaign Structure and Naming Convention",
    "category": "Build & Launch",
    "body": "# Build Campaign Structure and Naming Convention\n\n**Category:** Build & Launch\n**Source:** Module 3 Lesson 6\n**When to use:** Every new campaign build. Day 5 to 6 of onboarding pipeline.\n**Estimated time:** 20 to 30 min\n\n---\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- [ ] Ad account access confirmed\n- [ ] Pixel installed and firing (or Lead Forms ready)\n- [ ] Creatives approved by client\n- [ ] Daily budget agreed with client\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [ ] **Decide ABO vs CBO:**\n  - [ ] New client or testing new audiences: ABO\n  - [ ] Proven audiences and scaling: CBO\n  - [ ] Default for every new client: ABO Testing first\n- [ ] **Create the campaign:**\n  - [ ] Objective: Leads (for local businesses)\n  - [ ] Name format: [Client] - [Goal] - [Type], e.g. \"Tony's Pizza - Leads - ABO Testing\"\n- [ ] **Create Ad Set 1 (Broad):**\n  - [ ] Name: [Audience] - [Location] - [Age], e.g. \"Broad - Tampa 10mi - 25-55\"\n  - [ ] Budget: $10 to $15/day\n  - [ ] Targeting: Broad, location radius only (no interests)\n  - [ ] Age range: only if relevant to niche\n- [ ] **Create Ad Set 2 (Interest test, optional):**\n  - [ ] Name: \"Interest - [Relevant Interest] - 25-55\"\n  - [ ] Budget: $10 to $15/day\n  - [ ] Same 3 ads as Ad Set 1 so you test audience, not creative\n- [ ] **Upload 3 ads per ad set:**\n  - [ ] Name format: [Format] - [Hook/Angle] - [Version], e.g. \"Image - Family Deal $19.99 - V1\"\n  - [ ] Mix formats: image, video, carousel\n  - [ ] Mix angles: different reason to buy each\n- [ ] **Verify daily total:**\n  - [ ] $20 to $30/day expected at launch\n  - [ ] Confirm matches what client agreed to\n- [ ] **Do not publish yet.** Run pre-launch QA checklist first.\n\n## Notes\n\n- Three levels, top-down: Campaign (the goal), Ad Set (targeting + budget), Ad (the creative).\n- Never let a client start below $10/day. Meta doesn't have enough budget to learn at that level.\n- Naming saves you at 2am when a client texts \"why did my ad stop?\" You need to find the right campaign in 5 seconds.\n- Once Ad Set 1 wins for 3+ days at target CPL, move it into a CBO campaign for scaling.\n\n## Related SOPs\n\n- targeting-setup-broad\n- vortex-creative-diversity-check\n- pre-launch-qa-checklist\n- ad-copy-12-angle-generation\n- niche-campaign-templates\n"
